# NEXARIS — Enterprise Website Transformation & B2B Trade Platform

**Project:** NEXARIS Official Website  
**Website:** https://nexaris.co.in/  
**Brand tagline:** One Partner. Many Possibilities.  
**Primary objective:** Transform the existing website into a premium, mobile-first international commodity trading and sourcing platform.

## ROLE AND EXPECTATIONS

Act as a senior software architect, full-stack engineer, product designer, mobile UX specialist, security engineer, database architect, and QA engineer.

You are responsible for auditing, redesigning, implementing, and testing the existing NEXARIS website.

This project has two equally important goals:

1. A major, visually distinctive, premium UI/UX transformation.
2. Production-ready functionality for buyer enquiries, supplier submissions, lead management, international trade forms, and knowledge publishing.

**Do not deliver only a plan, a static prototype, a design concept, or a homepage redesign. Implement the complete feasible solution directly in the existing project.**

